From f2ca81f4f015b8fcbc0abcfe7a0150585fc2b726 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason McCartney <jmacAJ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 08:05:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 29/37] bench(glm): reject FlashKDA prefill integration

Correct the operator harness, add N=1/BF16 and projection-stride coverage, and record the exact same-image endpoint A/B. FlashKDA remains 2.6x faster with adapter packing but fails the medium/large staggered serving gate, so no production integration is retained.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
